[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4381.91, "timestamp": "01:13:01", "text": "现在。现在好多了。它说哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4385.51, "timestamp": "01:13:05", "text": "等待。跑了95。好的。不能留着这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4387.51, "timestamp": "01:13:07", "text": "因为我传送了自己，所以速度达到了95。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4390.63, "timestamp": "01:13:10", "text": "例如，在实例中距离2000个街区。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4392.95, "timestamp": "01:13:12", "text": "那片丛林区域尚未加载。这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4396.79, "timestamp": "01:13:16", "text": "是的，我现在正在寻找生物群落。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4399.11, "timestamp": "01:13:19", "text": "好的。就像樱花盛开的生态区一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4404.91, "timestamp": "01:13:24", "text": "只能做一件事。我想做一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4407.31, "timestamp": "01:13:27", "text": "事物。能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4414.149, "timestamp": "01:13:34", "text": "回家前请闭嘴好吗？让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4415.91, "timestamp": "01:13:35", "text": "想知道你是否愿意帮我排练。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4418.31, "timestamp": "01:13:38", "text": "是是是，当然是，当然。眼下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4422.11, "timestamp": "01:13:42", "text": "不。但我会跳进去的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4425.39, "timestamp": "01:13:45", "text": "之后。其实我并不能真的放置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4433.51, "timestamp": "01:13:53", "text": "落后41个刻度。嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4434.95, "timestamp": "01:13:54", "text": "是的，我在这里建了一个村庄。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4439.189, "timestamp": "01:13:59", "text": "这就是问题所在。我刚刚下单了"}]